## Why This Is Asked

Gauges a candidate's ability to design streaming, scalable PCA with missing data and drift in production environments.

## Key Concepts

- Incremental PCA / SVD, sliding window approaches
- Online imputation for missing data, streaming normalization
- Drift detection in loadings and explained variance
- Real-time alerting tied to interpretable loadings

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: incremental update sketch
let components = initPCA(12);
for (each batch) {
  let X = imputeOnline(batch);
  X = normalize(X);
  components = updateSVD(components, X);
  let loadings = computeLoadings(components);
  if (driftDetected(loadings)) alert(loadings);
}
```

