## Why This Is Asked
Addresses online PCA, non-stationary data, and real-time alerting under strict latency in a fintech gateway.

## Key Concepts
- Incremental PCA with partial_fit and streaming scaling
- Concept drift detection (Page-Hinkley/ADWIN) for component updates
- Rolling window vs. memory budget in streaming
- Handling missing data in a streaming context and latency concerns

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: online IPCA with drift checks
const ipca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents: 8});
let scaler = new StreamingScaler();
for (const x of stream) {
  const y = impute(x.features); // last observation
  const z = scaler.partialFitTransform(y);
  ipca.partialFit(z);
  const loadings = ipca.components_;
  if (driftDetected(loadings)) alert("drift");
}
```

